# Deploy
PRIVATE_KEY!
BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL!   # SINGLE url — forge/foundry.toml cannot parse the backend's comma-separated form
ETHERSCAN_API_KEY!

# Existing deployment the seed/PBM scripts run against
GANTRY_CORE_ADDRESS!    # deployed core; the scripts never redeploy it

# SeedDemo (optional)
MERCHANT_PAYOUT         # demo merchant payout address; defaults to deployer (script warns)

# DeployPBM — historical: it creates a RELAYER-owned wallet, and agent wallets are payer-owned now.
# Do not re-run it against a live deployment. Only registerMerchant is guarded; the factory deploy,
# createWallet and setPolicy all run unconditionally, so a re-run mints a NEW factory that
# addresses.ts does not point at, orphaning every wallet payers have created through the old one.
# Provisioning a usable agent wallet is `pnpm demo:reset`.
AGENT_SIGNER_ADDRESS!   # agent session key's address (from packages/agent AGENT_SESSION_KEY)
GADGETHUB_PAYOUT        # rejection-beat merchant payout; defaults to deployer (script warns)
